      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "感觉周末过得太快了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc039_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "是，不过我们也做了很多事。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc039_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "而且没有觉得特别累。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc039_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "因为我们没有把时间排得太满。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc039_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "你最喜欢哪一段？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc039_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "今天早上的河边。你呢？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc039_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我喜欢昨天刚到的时候随便走走。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc039_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "看来你真的开始喜欢慢一点儿旅行了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc039_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对，而且小包也很成功。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc039_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "下次你不会再带电脑了吧？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc039_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "绝对不会。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc039_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "还有什么想改的？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc039_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "可能提前一点儿订住的地方。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc039_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "这样选择会更多。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc039_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "其他都很好。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc039_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "回杭州以后今晚别安排别的了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc039_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "同意。回家洗澡、吃点儿东西、早点儿睡。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc039_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
